-feedback-view__dropzone_bd054\"><svg class=\"native-client-feedback-view__dropzoneBorder_2bd60\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect></rect></svg>Browse files, or drop them here<p class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-tertiary_8f805 text__align-center_2a4f2\">Accepted file types: text, PDFs, images, and videos<br>Up to 5 files, 20MB each</p></button></div><div class=\"native-client-feedback-view__toggleRow_a5433\"><span class=\"native-client-feedback-view__logIcon_19fb9\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" src=\"http://localhost:4317/extension-raycast-core-BDfvxXsA.png\"></span><label id=\"feedback-logs-label\">Include Bayrust Logs</label><button type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-size=\"medium\" aria-labelledby=\"feedback-logs-label\" class=\"switch__root_ae6f6\"><span class=\"switch__thumb_95b10\"></span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"hidden\" class=\"scroll-area__scrollbar_4ff0e\" style=\"top: 2px; bottom: 2px; right: 3px; --thumb-height: 594.664156626506px;\"><div data-state=\"visible\" class=\"scroll-area__thumb_99821\" style=\"width: var(--thumb-width); height: var(--thumb-height); transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\"></div></div></div><footer class=\"native-client-feedback-view__footer_2f1c5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"base-button__root_6db87 radius__radius-8_b77d9 button-primitive__root_18197\" data-variant=\"ghost\" data-size=\"medium\"><span class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-inherit_d96ab text__align-left_43d84 text__truncate_0bd29\">Cancel</span><div class=\"shortcut__shortcut_fca75\"><kbd class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-11_638bc text__weight-500_9bfa4 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84 radius__radius-6_ff8c8 shortcut__kbd_cb7d1\" data-size=\"small\" data-variant=\"default\">Esc</kbd></div></button><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"base-button__root_6db87 radius__radius-8_b77d9 button-primitive__root_18197 native-client-feedback-view__submitButton_88ed9\" data-variant=\"default\" data-size=\"medium\"><span class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-13_31bc4 text__weight-400_36886 text__color-inherit_d96ab text__align-left_43d84 text__truncate_0bd29\">Submit Feedback</span><div class=\"shortcut__shortcut_fca75 native-client-feedback-view__submitShortcut_ce106\"><kbd class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-11_638bc text__weight-500_9bfa4 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84 radius__radius-6_ff8c8 shortcut__kbd_cb7d1\" data-size=\"small\" data-variant=\"default\">⌘</kbd><kbd class=\"text__text_054b5 text__font-inter_5a99a text__size-11_638bc text__weight-500_9bfa4 text__color-primary_37304 text__align-left_43d84 radius__radius-6_ff8c8 shortcut__kbd_cb7d1\" data-size=\"small\" data-variant=\"default\">↵</kbd></div></button></footer></form></div></div></div>\n  \n\n</body>",
